# A type error inside a {hole} is reported where it was written in the
# string.
== SOURCE
x := 6
@ f_ormat< "x is {x + \"a\"}"
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Int, found Char
 --> -e:2:19
  |
2 | @ f_ormat< "x is {x + \"a\"}"
  |                   ^^^^^^^^
  |                   - `x` is an Int
  |                       ---- a string: a vector of Char
  |
1 | x := 6
  |      - `x` gets its type here
  = note: `+` has type Num a => a -> a -> a
